# ==========================================================================
#  eLinx 工程引脚约束文件 (PSF - Pin Specification File)
#
#  用法: 在本文件中定义 FPGA 引脚分配, eLinx 的 PACK/PLACE 阶段会自动读取。
#
#  生成方式:
#    1. 在 eLinx GUI 中打开工程 → Pin Planner → 分配引脚 → 导出 .psf
#    2. 或根据硬件原理图手动填写以下格式
#
#  格式:
#    set_location_assignment PIN_XX -to signal_name
#    set_instance_assignment -name IO_STANDARD "3.3-V LVTTL" -to signal_name
# ==========================================================================

# ---- 时钟引脚 ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to clk_in1
# set_instance_assignment -name IO_STANDARD "3.3-V LVTTL" -to clk_in1

# ---- ADC 接口 ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to ad_data[0]
# ...
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to ad_data[9]
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to ad_clk
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to ad_oe_n

# ---- DAC 接口 ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to da_data[0]
# ...
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to da_data[9]
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to da_clk

# ---- UART 接口 ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to uart_rx
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to uart_tx

# ---- 按键 ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key1_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key2_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key3_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key4_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key5_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to key6_n

# ---- LED ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to led1_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to led2_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to led3_n
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to led4_n

# ---- 蜂鸣器 (可选) ----
# set_location_assignment PIN_?? -to buzzer_en

puts "[PSF] 使用自动引脚分配 (未配置具体引脚约束)"
puts "[PSF] 请通过 eLinx GUI → Pin Planner 完成引脚分配后更新此文件"
